Z||000004||Haze_Performance||11-28-2001||02:30 AM||||Well... Without seeing detailed pics I would say, WITH the wheels you could get $3200/$3500.. <P>Think of it this way... If you saw your car at a used car lot, You KNOW they will try to sell it for more than that... I've seen TONS of 4cyl. Fieros in lots... Most are priced high & they do sell... Theres a buyer for everything..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  <P><BR>Good Luck  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR>-Haze<P><BR>(P.S. Nice Car)  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/goodlife.gif">    <BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="purple">Goto Website - <A HREF="http://www.ClassicFiero.com" TARGET=_blank>Click Here</A> </FONT></FONT>||||reg||14
